{"2717150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Releaseburg", "steam_appid": 2717150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/3690d3e93812720a5dd82321ba099e49.poster.avif?t=1761898368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/3690d3e93812720a5dd82321ba099e49.webm?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/3690d3e93812720a5dd82321ba099e49.mp4?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to the relentless world of Blood Purge: Releaseburg, an immersive <strong>rogue-like</strong> experience set in a post-apocalyptic city overrun by hordes of gruesome <strong>zombies</strong>. With our exceptional <strong>release-based shooting</strong> mechanic, every encounter becomes a thrilling test of precision and strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/7ea4b21328f0f9454cf0973e4ba93e1e.avif?t=1761898368\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><br>Arm yourself with a diverse array of weapons, from <strong>pistols </strong>for quick, calculated shots to <strong>rifles </strong>for strategic precision and <strong>burst-fire </strong>for close-quarters mayhem. Adapt your play style to navigate the blood-soaked streets and face various challenging enemies, each demanding a unique approach to survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/651d8edf0667e682fc6c82fe176b1f76.poster.avif?t=1761898368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/651d8edf0667e682fc6c82fe176b1f76.webm?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/651d8edf0667e682fc6c82fe176b1f76.mp4?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game's dynamic, random-generated levels ensure that no two playthroughs are ever the same, providing endless challenges and opportunities for exploration. Brace yourself for intense, visceral encounters as you wade through the <strong>blood and gore</strong>, carving your path through the unforgiving urban landscape. Blood Purge: Releaseburg promises a gripping, ever-evolving adventure where your every decision and shot can mean the difference between survival and becoming just another victim in this brutal, post-apocalyptic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/7313f5ed2a742300a07a6b42c9ab0cb3.poster.avif?t=1761898368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/7313f5ed2a742300a07a6b42c9ab0cb3.webm?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/7313f5ed2a742300a07a6b42c9ab0cb3.mp4?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/3690d3e93812720a5dd82321ba099e49.poster.avif?t=1761898368\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717150/extras/3690d3e93812720a5dd82321ba099e49.webm?t=1761898368\" type=\"video/webm; 